1
00:01:51,420 --> 00:01:52,200
It hurts.

2
00:01:54,040 --> 00:01:54,840
It hurts.

3
00:01:56,000 --> 00:01:56,799
It hurts.

4
00:01:58,780 --> 00:01:59,739
I need to take my medicine.

5
00:02:01,859 --> 00:02:02,939
I need to take my medicine.

6
00:02:04,859 --> 00:02:05,659
It hurts.

7
00:02:10,520 --> 00:02:12,199
Here, take your medicine.

8
00:02:12,360 --> 00:02:13,259
Sit up a bit.

9
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:21,199
Thank you, my lady.

10
00:02:25,400 --> 00:02:25,979
Here.

11
00:02:31,120 --> 00:02:31,900
My lady,

12
00:02:33,199 --> 00:02:34,159
do you think

13
00:02:35,620 --> 00:02:37,479
Nanping can hold out?

14
00:02:42,020 --> 00:02:42,680
Yes.

15
00:02:43,699 --> 00:02:44,500
It will.

16
00:02:46,919 --> 00:02:47,800
That's good.

17
00:02:49,419 --> 00:02:50,419
After the battle,

18
00:02:51,659 --> 00:02:52,659
I'll go home.

19
00:02:55,500 --> 00:02:57,159
My mother is waiting for me.

20
00:03:15,939 --> 00:03:16,719
My Lady,

21
00:03:18,139 --> 00:03:19,360
you're more

22
00:03:20,080 --> 00:03:21,219
enlightened than me.

23
00:03:23,159 --> 00:03:23,939
When will

24
00:03:26,360 --> 00:03:28,360
this war

25
00:03:29,699 --> 00:03:31,319
between our own people

26
00:03:33,139 --> 00:03:34,340
come to an end?

27
00:03:37,659 --> 00:03:38,659
My arm

28
00:03:41,780 --> 00:03:43,379
was broken by my own people.

29
00:03:45,800 --> 00:03:46,879
It's not worth it.

30
00:04:22,980 --> 00:04:24,300
The heroism of the soldiers

31
00:04:24,860 --> 00:04:26,180
should not be used in civil war.

32
00:04:27,279 --> 00:04:29,620
When can we unite against external threats,

33
00:04:30,519 --> 00:04:31,779
so that this land

34
00:04:32,399 --> 00:04:33,279
will no longer be stained

35
00:04:33,279 --> 00:04:35,019
by the blood of our own people?

36
00:04:43,860 --> 00:04:44,800
Flank them from both sides.

37
00:04:45,079 --> 00:04:46,100
Wait for them to get close before we attack.

38
00:05:18,040 --> 00:05:18,680
Go!

39
00:06:51,899 --> 00:06:52,699
You're back.

40
00:07:00,339 --> 00:07:01,160
Did I wake you?

41
00:07:04,519 --> 00:07:05,199
Don't get up.

42
00:07:14,639 --> 00:07:16,259
Your hands are so cold.

43
00:07:16,899 --> 00:07:17,759
Let me warm them up for you.

44
00:07:17,939 --> 00:07:18,639
Stop it.

45
00:07:21,399 --> 00:07:21,939
It took a while

46
00:07:21,939 --> 00:07:23,779
to get warm under the covers.

47
00:07:24,259 --> 00:07:25,399
My cold hands will shock you.

48
00:07:25,980 --> 00:07:26,920
Can your body handle it?

49
00:07:34,939 --> 00:07:35,699
Your beard

50
00:07:36,899 --> 00:07:37,579
is itchy.

51
00:07:45,000 --> 00:07:46,060
You've been so busy these days

52
00:07:46,839 --> 00:07:48,019
that you forgot to shave.

53
00:08:08,420 --> 00:08:09,800
It seems that

54
00:08:12,019 --> 00:08:14,279
even if Changxuan wins,

55
00:08:16,120 --> 00:08:18,699
there won't be much left of the Yu's Army.

56
00:08:20,439 --> 00:08:22,199
The team is almost depleted.

57
00:08:23,740 --> 00:08:24,740
I understand that

58
00:08:25,699 --> 00:08:27,639
The Yu's army is your lifelong effort,

59
00:08:28,180 --> 00:08:31,000
and the foundation of your protection.

60
00:08:31,839 --> 00:08:33,440
You're worried about the safety of Yue.

61
00:08:34,080 --> 00:08:35,639
Every time the phone rings,

62
00:08:36,399 --> 00:08:37,159
you're...

63
00:08:47,379 --> 00:08:48,059
Commander,

64
00:08:48,500 --> 00:08:49,879
there is a reply from the Jun family.

65
00:08:50,840 --> 00:08:51,679
What's the reply?

66
00:08:51,740 --> 00:08:52,820
Deputy Minister Jun said

67
00:08:53,500 --> 00:08:54,620
he could put pressure on the central government

68
00:08:54,620 --> 00:08:55,879
through his brother

69
00:08:55,879 --> 00:08:57,059
to immediately withdraw

70
00:08:57,320 --> 00:08:59,279
all military and logistical support

71
00:08:59,440 --> 00:09:00,639
for the joint forces of Chumo.

72
00:09:01,080 --> 00:09:02,539
That would be great.

73
00:09:02,759 --> 00:09:03,559
But

74
00:09:04,720 --> 00:09:05,919
Deputy Minister Jun

75
00:09:06,039 --> 00:09:07,940
also made it clear that he has a condition.

76
00:09:07,940 --> 00:09:08,879
What is it?

77
00:09:09,139 --> 00:09:10,139
He said

78
00:09:10,639 --> 00:09:12,639
if we want their full support,

79
00:09:13,039 --> 00:09:15,100
the two families must marry.

80
00:09:29,539 --> 00:09:30,240
My brother.

81
00:09:32,320 --> 00:09:32,980
What's up?

82
00:09:33,620 --> 00:09:34,679
A newly deciphered telegram.

83
00:09:36,700 --> 00:09:37,860
The support from the central government to Chumo

84
00:09:37,919 --> 00:09:38,899
far exceeds our estimates.

85
00:09:39,259 --> 00:09:40,539
In addition to ammunition and silver dollars,

86
00:09:40,759 --> 00:09:42,120
three artillery regiments are also dispatched.

87
00:09:43,240 --> 00:09:44,659
It seems that they are determined

88
00:09:45,519 --> 00:09:47,080
to use Chumo

89
00:09:47,899 --> 00:09:49,779
to destroy our entire army.

90
00:10:26,419 --> 00:10:27,039
Pingjun,

91
00:10:28,700 --> 00:10:29,379
are you alright?

92
00:10:32,639 --> 00:10:33,620
I'm fine.

93
00:10:57,620 --> 00:10:58,559
Congratulations, Deputy Commander,

94
00:10:58,639 --> 00:11:00,100
your wife is pregnant.

95
00:11:01,259 --> 00:11:02,299
Are you sure?

96
00:11:03,159 --> 00:11:03,740
Yes.

97
00:11:04,159 --> 00:11:05,940
But the fetus is a bit unstable.

98
00:11:06,120 --> 00:11:07,419
She must rest well.

99
00:11:07,539 --> 00:11:09,399
She can't be too tired.

100
00:11:57,259 --> 00:11:58,120
My dear,

101
00:12:00,419 --> 00:12:01,399
you're going to be a mother.

102
00:12:06,179 --> 00:12:07,440
And you're going to be a father.

103
00:12:11,899 --> 00:12:13,240
I just don't know

104
00:12:14,460 --> 00:12:16,200
if it's a girl

105
00:12:17,200 --> 00:12:18,620
or a boy.

106
00:12:20,639 --> 00:12:21,279
What?

107
00:12:22,279 --> 00:12:23,740
If it's a boy,

108
00:12:23,840 --> 00:12:25,139
are you going to be biased?

109
00:12:26,860 --> 00:12:27,879
I just like girls.

110
00:12:29,139 --> 00:12:30,059
Girls are like you.

111
00:12:32,980 --> 00:12:34,480
I heard that

112
00:12:35,059 --> 00:12:37,419
eating more apples during pregnancy

113
00:12:38,039 --> 00:12:39,460
can make the baby's skin

114
00:12:39,460 --> 00:12:40,539
brighter.

115
00:12:41,139 --> 00:12:43,320
And eat more sesame and walnuts,

116
00:12:43,600 --> 00:12:45,059
so the baby will be smart.

117
00:12:46,100 --> 00:12:47,899
When you go back to Nanhua,

118
00:12:48,019 --> 00:12:49,559
just tell me what you want to eat.

119
00:12:50,039 --> 00:12:51,299
I will find all kinds of ways

120
00:12:52,039 --> 00:12:53,080
to make you happy

121
00:12:53,419 --> 00:12:54,639
when I know you're pregnant.

122
00:12:59,500 --> 00:13:00,899
I won't go back.

123
00:13:01,320 --> 00:13:02,460
I'll just stay here

124
00:13:02,960 --> 00:13:04,200
and be with you.

125
00:13:05,039 --> 00:13:05,820
Pingjun,

126
00:13:07,320 --> 00:13:08,700
now that you're pregnant,

127
00:13:10,539 --> 00:13:12,340
it's even more worrying for me

128
00:13:13,700 --> 00:13:15,200
if you stay on the front line.

129
00:13:20,960 --> 00:13:22,500
Just let me fight

130
00:13:22,899 --> 00:13:24,539
a beautiful battle,

131
00:13:25,600 --> 00:13:26,539
and then I'll come back to see you.

132
00:13:28,799 --> 00:13:29,299
Okay?

133
00:13:31,600 --> 00:13:32,659
Yu Changxuan,

134
00:13:36,759 --> 00:13:38,600
my mother and sister have told me

135
00:13:40,220 --> 00:13:41,440
that pregnant women

136
00:13:42,059 --> 00:13:43,159
shouldn't cry.

137
00:13:44,320 --> 00:13:45,399
If you cry too much,

138
00:13:46,899 --> 00:13:48,059
the baby will be ugly.

139
00:13:50,019 --> 00:13:51,299
Nonsense.

140
00:14:11,820 --> 00:14:13,179
You and our child

141
00:14:15,059 --> 00:14:16,440
are my greatest weakness.

142
00:14:18,200 --> 00:14:19,840
Only if you and the baby are safe

143
00:14:21,279 --> 00:14:21,700
can I

144
00:14:21,700 --> 00:14:23,500
focus on the battle.

145
00:14:25,299 --> 00:14:26,159
I know

146
00:14:28,539 --> 00:14:30,519
I wasn't a good husband before,

147
00:14:32,220 --> 00:14:33,039
but from now on,

148
00:14:34,220 --> 00:14:34,700
I'll try

149
00:14:34,700 --> 00:14:36,259
to be a good father.

150
00:14:38,299 --> 00:14:39,259
For you,

151
00:14:41,919 --> 00:14:43,639
I'll do my best.

152
00:14:51,120 --> 00:14:52,519
Then you must promise me,

153
00:14:54,580 --> 00:14:56,440
you must come back safely.

154
00:15:08,879 --> 00:15:09,940
I promise you.

155
00:15:22,220 --> 00:15:23,480
When I'm not around,

156
00:15:24,399 --> 00:15:25,919
be good and listen to your mother.

157
00:15:27,000 --> 00:15:28,019
and behave yourself.

158
00:15:28,820 --> 00:15:29,460
Do you understand?

159
00:16:19,740 --> 00:16:20,539
My lady,

160
00:16:20,720 --> 00:16:21,820
we're almost at the dock.

161
00:16:23,799 --> 00:16:24,320
Okay.

162
00:16:25,360 --> 00:16:26,440
Let's go back

163
00:16:27,480 --> 00:16:28,779
and wait for daddy together.

164
00:16:57,039 --> 00:16:57,879
Three, five, six, four.

165
00:16:59,919 --> 00:17:00,740
Seven, six, four.

166
00:17:01,139 --> 00:17:01,899
Mr. Gu.

167
00:17:03,200 --> 00:17:03,899
Mr. Gu.

168
00:17:04,700 --> 00:17:05,539
Mr. Gu.

169
00:17:05,799 --> 00:17:06,299
Gu...

170
00:17:06,859 --> 00:17:07,420
Mr. Gu.

171
00:17:07,660 --> 00:17:08,079
What's the matter?

172
00:17:09,339 --> 00:17:09,940
Director Gu,

173
00:17:10,140 --> 00:17:10,940
a word in private, please.

174
00:17:38,920 --> 00:17:40,339
Can you guarantee what you said?

175
00:17:49,079 --> 00:17:50,640
Can you guarantee what you said?

176
00:17:51,299 --> 00:17:52,160
Absolutely right.

177
00:18:09,759 --> 00:18:11,119
If we flank them

178
00:18:11,500 --> 00:18:12,880
from the side

179
00:18:12,960 --> 00:18:14,680
and directly attack their ace regiment,

180
00:18:14,680 --> 00:18:16,339
we might have a chance.

181
00:18:17,059 --> 00:18:17,599
Yes.

182
00:18:17,779 --> 00:18:18,920
Chu Wenfu's ace regiment

183
00:18:18,920 --> 00:18:19,680
is tough,

184
00:18:19,680 --> 00:18:20,880
but they've been worn down by us,

185
00:18:21,079 --> 00:18:22,200
leaving only 30% of their strength.

186
00:18:22,279 --> 00:18:23,559
The casualty statistics are out.

187
00:18:24,119 --> 00:18:25,180
I'll go compile them.

188
00:18:29,480 --> 00:18:30,119
Gu.

189
00:18:31,140 --> 00:18:31,900
What's wrong?

190
00:18:34,000 --> 00:18:35,000
What's wrong with you?

191
00:18:38,039 --> 00:18:38,839
What's wrong, Ruitong?

192
00:18:46,259 --> 00:18:47,079
What's going on?

193
00:18:51,779 --> 00:18:52,559
My brother.

194
00:18:56,940 --> 00:18:57,819
You guys go out first.

195
00:18:58,039 --> 00:18:58,859
Yes.

196
00:19:06,220 --> 00:19:06,859
What's wrong?

197
00:19:09,019 --> 00:19:10,980
The boat Qianzi took back to Nanhua

198
00:19:12,880 --> 00:19:13,940
exploded near

199
00:19:13,940 --> 00:19:15,119
Jiangxin Island.

200
00:19:19,920 --> 00:19:20,779
What did you say?

201
00:19:22,359 --> 00:19:24,259
The ship exploded and caught fire,

202
00:19:25,599 --> 00:19:26,400
then

203
00:19:27,319 --> 00:19:28,599
sank to the bottom of the river.

204
00:19:30,359 --> 00:19:31,220
No one

205
00:19:32,759 --> 00:19:33,720
survived.

206
00:19:44,839 --> 00:19:46,160
What nonsense are you talking about?

207
00:19:48,460 --> 00:19:49,319
How is this possible?

208
00:19:51,039 --> 00:19:52,319
They found out that

209
00:19:53,140 --> 00:19:54,779
when the ship was near Linbei,

210
00:19:55,819 --> 00:19:56,680
Chu Wenfu's

211
00:19:56,680 --> 00:19:57,980
ammunition transport ship approached.

212
00:20:16,539 --> 00:20:17,960
We were together yesterday.

213
00:20:20,660 --> 00:20:22,019
You must have heard wrong.

214
00:20:27,920 --> 00:20:28,779
My lord.

215
00:20:29,339 --> 00:20:30,819
My lord, are you okay?

216
00:20:30,940 --> 00:20:32,059
My lord.

217
00:20:32,420 --> 00:20:33,200
My lord.

218
00:20:33,759 --> 00:20:34,960
Call the doctor.

219
00:20:35,259 --> 00:20:37,400
Somebody, help!

220
00:20:37,799 --> 00:20:39,099
Somebody, help!

221
00:21:08,839 --> 00:21:11,500
Mom, who was that on the phone?

222
00:21:13,220 --> 00:21:14,880
You look pale.

223
00:21:17,019 --> 00:21:18,420
How come?

224
00:21:20,119 --> 00:21:21,140
Pingjun...

225
00:21:22,640 --> 00:21:23,759
What happened to her?

226
00:21:24,339 --> 00:21:25,380
Didn't she say

227
00:21:25,500 --> 00:21:26,799
she was coming back?

228
00:21:31,900 --> 00:21:34,180
The ship caught fire on the river.

229
00:21:40,119 --> 00:21:41,559
She's dead.

230
00:21:44,599 --> 00:21:48,099
Mother, are you saying that my sister-in-law...

231
00:21:49,099 --> 00:21:51,240
Mother, is it confirmed?

232
00:21:51,559 --> 00:21:51,859
Yes.

233
00:21:52,099 --> 00:21:53,900
Did Gu Ruitong call?

234
00:21:55,220 --> 00:21:56,920
Ruitong said it himself.

235
00:22:01,779 --> 00:22:04,039
Pingjun was pregnant.

236
00:22:10,539 --> 00:22:11,539
How could it be?

237
00:23:10,299 --> 00:23:11,380
Why is there a tear

238
00:23:11,440 --> 00:23:12,980
in your shirt?

239
00:23:13,900 --> 00:23:15,099
I don't remember.

240
00:23:37,180 --> 00:23:38,900
You've been working on these

241
00:23:39,240 --> 00:23:40,599
battlefield reports for days.

242
00:23:41,579 --> 00:23:42,519
Don't overwork yourself.

243
00:23:43,500 --> 00:23:45,119
These are all first-hand information.

244
00:23:45,500 --> 00:23:46,259
I want to get them

245
00:23:46,259 --> 00:23:47,220
all organized quickly.

246
00:24:07,599 --> 00:24:08,480
Pingjun,

247
00:24:10,759 --> 00:24:12,599
I understand the meaning of your words.

248
00:24:15,079 --> 00:24:16,240
I can also understand

249
00:24:16,420 --> 00:24:17,579
what you want to do.

250
00:24:18,740 --> 00:24:19,779
But every second

251
00:24:19,779 --> 00:24:21,099
on the battlefield

252
00:24:22,099 --> 00:24:23,539
is full of danger.

253
00:24:25,920 --> 00:24:27,420
I know your concerns.

254
00:24:27,859 --> 00:24:28,819
Don't worry.

255
00:24:29,519 --> 00:24:31,200
I will take care of myself.

256
00:24:32,279 --> 00:24:34,160
I just want to show everyone

257
00:24:34,900 --> 00:24:36,240
that the blood of the Chinese people

258
00:24:37,119 --> 00:24:38,640
shouldn't be shed because of civil war.

259
00:24:43,700 --> 00:24:44,880
Then promise me,

260
00:24:47,700 --> 00:24:49,559
stay in the rear,

261
00:24:51,180 --> 00:24:52,980
never get close to the front line.

262
00:24:57,079 --> 00:24:58,359
I will never

263
00:24:58,420 --> 00:25:00,539
put myself in danger.

264
00:25:26,400 --> 00:25:28,559
Prepare a good burial place

265
00:25:30,319 --> 00:25:33,500
in the western suburban cemetery

266
00:25:34,440 --> 00:25:35,420
for Ye Pingjun

267
00:25:37,279 --> 00:25:39,079
and her

268
00:25:39,779 --> 00:25:41,859
child.

269
00:25:43,099 --> 00:25:43,799
Commander,

270
00:25:45,240 --> 00:25:47,920
this is unexpected.

271
00:25:49,740 --> 00:25:50,339
My condolences.

272
00:25:52,579 --> 00:25:54,359
You have no idea

273
00:25:55,940 --> 00:25:58,160
how I feel now.

274
00:25:59,740 --> 00:26:00,740
It's like

275
00:26:00,740 --> 00:26:03,640
a huge chunk

276
00:26:05,579 --> 00:26:07,319
has been ripped out of my heart.

277
00:26:23,420 --> 00:26:25,579
To get to this point,

278
00:26:28,180 --> 00:26:30,660
I've got blood all over my hands.

279
00:26:33,299 --> 00:26:34,599
This path

280
00:26:37,539 --> 00:26:40,680
has been a one-way road

281
00:26:43,019 --> 00:26:46,160
since I agreed to the Jun family.

282
00:27:03,660 --> 00:27:04,339
Mr. Jiang,

283
00:27:04,900 --> 00:27:06,619
several veterans in Nanjing

284
00:27:06,619 --> 00:27:08,000
have jointly recommended you to the Council.

285
00:27:08,460 --> 00:27:09,460
The news has spread,

286
00:27:10,420 --> 00:27:12,240
and many influential figures in the city

287
00:27:12,519 --> 00:27:13,339
are lining up

288
00:27:13,420 --> 00:27:14,859
to offer their congratulations.

289
00:27:17,440 --> 00:27:18,559
You are young and promising,

290
00:27:18,640 --> 00:27:19,700
with profound knowledge,

291
00:27:19,880 --> 00:27:20,460
and highly regarded

292
00:27:20,460 --> 00:27:22,180
by several central elders.

293
00:27:22,500 --> 00:27:23,880
Our Jiang residence

294
00:27:23,980 --> 00:27:26,200
is truly bustling this time.

295
00:27:26,700 --> 00:27:27,720
If your wife knew,

296
00:27:28,240 --> 00:27:29,759
she would be over the moon.

297
00:27:30,940 --> 00:27:31,599
I'm not going back to the residence.

298
00:27:33,920 --> 00:27:34,759
Head to the villa.

299
00:27:35,519 --> 00:27:36,039
Yes, sir.

300
00:27:47,599 --> 00:27:48,119
Commissioner Jiang.

301
00:27:51,079 --> 00:27:51,779
Commissioner Jiang.

302
00:27:54,279 --> 00:27:55,380
You guys go out first.

303
00:27:55,920 --> 00:27:56,539
Yes.

304
00:28:24,019 --> 00:28:24,839
Jiang Xueting,

305
00:28:26,819 --> 00:28:28,339
how dare you do this to me?

306
00:28:30,799 --> 00:28:32,059
You finally came back.

307
00:28:34,799 --> 00:28:35,460
Pingjun,

308
00:28:41,039 --> 00:28:42,500
we're finally together again.

309
00:28:44,619 --> 00:28:45,859
You're now a

310
00:28:45,859 --> 00:28:47,500
person of importance.

311
00:28:48,359 --> 00:28:50,259
You should be more open and aboveboard.

312
00:28:51,940 --> 00:28:52,599
Why did you

313
00:28:52,599 --> 00:28:54,019
abduct me here for no reason?

314
00:28:55,539 --> 00:28:56,420
I want to go back to Nanhuai.

315
00:28:57,559 --> 00:28:58,099
Pingjun,

316
00:28:58,700 --> 00:28:59,619
you're angry again.

317
00:29:00,420 --> 00:29:01,279
I remember

318
00:29:01,700 --> 00:29:03,480
when you were a child,

319
00:29:04,059 --> 00:29:05,799
I just needed to apologize to you.

320
00:29:06,640 --> 00:29:07,700
I'll apologize to you again,

321
00:29:07,700 --> 00:29:08,559
okay?

322
00:29:09,799 --> 00:29:11,039
Show me some respect.

323
00:29:13,819 --> 00:29:14,519
Pingjun,

324
00:29:16,859 --> 00:29:18,240
whenever I'm sad,

325
00:29:19,440 --> 00:29:20,460
I just want to see you.

326
00:29:22,460 --> 00:29:23,299
But I've never

327
00:29:23,299 --> 00:29:24,519
been so crazy

328
00:29:25,440 --> 00:29:27,619
and passionate about seeing you like this.

329
00:29:29,480 --> 00:29:30,380
I was thinking

330
00:29:30,940 --> 00:29:32,779
you are my woman.

331
00:29:33,920 --> 00:29:35,220
One day,

332
00:29:35,619 --> 00:29:37,240
I will get you back.

333
00:29:40,599 --> 00:29:41,380
Pingjun.

334
00:29:45,859 --> 00:29:46,720
Jiang Xueting,

335
00:29:47,420 --> 00:29:48,700
you are a jerk.

336
00:29:49,079 --> 00:29:51,319
Yes, I am.

337
00:29:52,880 --> 00:29:54,059
For you,

338
00:29:54,660 --> 00:29:56,200
I am willing to be a jerk.

339
00:29:57,220 --> 00:29:58,599
I used to think

340
00:29:59,200 --> 00:30:00,740
I got everything.

341
00:30:01,099 --> 00:30:02,200
Even if I don't have you,

342
00:30:02,559 --> 00:30:03,579
it doesn't matter.

343
00:30:04,839 --> 00:30:06,279
But I later realized

344
00:30:07,279 --> 00:30:08,579
that even if I had everything,

345
00:30:08,579 --> 00:30:09,640
without you,

346
00:30:10,579 --> 00:30:11,900
it wouldn't be enough.

347
00:30:12,859 --> 00:30:14,680
You've already married Tao Ziyi,

348
00:30:15,819 --> 00:30:17,299
and I've married Yu Changxuan.

349
00:30:17,920 --> 00:30:18,579
You know

350
00:30:18,579 --> 00:30:20,079
this is impossible.

351
00:30:20,220 --> 00:30:21,640
If I say it's possible, it's possible.

352
00:30:46,940 --> 00:30:47,720
Somebody!

353
00:30:52,579 --> 00:30:53,380
Commissioner Jiang!

354
00:30:53,960 --> 00:30:54,940
Get a doctor!

355
00:30:55,240 --> 00:30:55,940
Right away!

356
00:30:56,380 --> 00:30:56,920
Yes, sir!

357
00:31:03,980 --> 00:31:04,960
Let go of me.

358
00:31:25,460 --> 00:31:27,240
You don't need to see a doctor.

359
00:31:30,019 --> 00:31:31,200
You're right.

360
00:31:34,140 --> 00:31:35,880
I'm pregnant with Yu Changxuan's child.

361
00:31:39,259 --> 00:31:40,259
Ye Pingjun,

362
00:31:41,700 --> 00:31:43,700
you ungrateful woman.

363
00:31:43,700 --> 00:31:44,359
Yes,

364
00:31:45,420 --> 00:31:46,720
I'm ungrateful.

365
00:31:47,559 --> 00:31:48,400
I don't deserve you.

366
00:31:48,400 --> 00:31:49,400
Let me go.

367
00:31:49,440 --> 00:31:50,220
No way.

368
00:31:52,759 --> 00:31:54,900
I won't let you have anything to do

369
00:31:54,900 --> 00:31:56,339
with Yu Changxuan anymore.

370
00:31:56,960 --> 00:31:57,940
Jiang Xueting,

371
00:31:59,420 --> 00:32:00,420
I'm telling you,

372
00:32:02,079 --> 00:32:03,740
my mother is watching from heaven.

373
00:32:05,660 --> 00:32:06,720
Aren't you afraid of

374
00:32:07,640 --> 00:32:09,119
retribution for doing this?

375
00:32:12,960 --> 00:32:14,420
Even if there is retribution,

376
00:32:15,160 --> 00:32:16,099
I must first get rid of

377
00:32:16,099 --> 00:32:18,259
the child in your belly.

378
00:32:19,299 --> 00:32:20,559
Then I'm telling you,

379
00:32:22,220 --> 00:32:23,960
don't even think about touching my child.

380
00:32:39,299 --> 00:32:40,140
Let me go.

381
00:32:41,740 --> 00:32:44,039
I'll let you take his child

382
00:32:44,460 --> 00:32:45,839
to find him.

383
00:32:46,980 --> 00:32:48,240
Don't even think about it.

384
00:32:49,160 --> 00:32:51,160
This child can't stay.

385
00:32:57,960 --> 00:32:59,640
If you dare to hurt him,

386
00:33:03,220 --> 00:33:05,019
if you dare to let this child

387
00:33:05,019 --> 00:33:06,440
be born in danger,

388
00:33:11,420 --> 00:33:12,859
I'll kill myself right now.

389
00:33:14,720 --> 00:33:15,920
I mean it.

390
00:33:28,779 --> 00:33:29,519
Fine.

391
00:33:32,220 --> 00:33:33,039
Fine.

392
00:33:35,440 --> 00:33:37,279
Ye Pingjun, you're ruthless.

393
00:33:38,940 --> 00:33:39,839
This child

394
00:33:39,839 --> 00:33:41,539
can stay for now.

395
00:33:42,900 --> 00:33:44,000
But I advise you

396
00:33:45,700 --> 00:33:48,420
to stay here and behave yourself.

397
00:33:49,720 --> 00:33:52,119
Don't have any other thoughts.

398
00:35:15,099 --> 00:35:17,079
When things have happened,

399
00:35:18,500 --> 00:35:20,159
we must choose to face them.

400
00:35:21,559 --> 00:35:22,940
I'm here to tell you,

401
00:35:24,239 --> 00:35:24,920
I've read

402
00:35:24,920 --> 00:35:27,159
all the articles

403
00:35:30,000 --> 00:35:31,179
Ms. Pingjun wrote on the front line.

404
00:35:33,199 --> 00:35:35,019
She wrote about the pain of wounded soldiers,

405
00:35:36,559 --> 00:35:38,159
the longing of soldiers for their homeland,

406
00:35:39,400 --> 00:35:40,820
and the fear of displacement

407
00:35:41,980 --> 00:35:43,860
among the common people.

408
00:35:45,420 --> 00:35:47,019
But she didn't just write about suffering.

409
00:35:48,099 --> 00:35:49,280
She was asking

410
00:35:51,239 --> 00:35:52,780
how long this endless internal strife,

411
00:35:53,619 --> 00:35:54,679
this tragedy of

412
00:35:55,519 --> 00:35:57,059
fighting among ourselves,

413
00:35:58,139 --> 00:35:59,599
would continue.

414
00:36:00,820 --> 00:36:02,880
How much more blood must be shed

415
00:36:03,639 --> 00:36:04,820
before it stops?

416
00:36:07,380 --> 00:36:08,280
Jin,

417
00:36:10,619 --> 00:36:12,699
I really hate myself.

418
00:36:14,960 --> 00:36:15,800
How could I

419
00:36:15,800 --> 00:36:17,179
not have protected them?

420
00:36:18,420 --> 00:36:19,420
Changxuan,

421
00:36:21,000 --> 00:36:21,800
this pain

422
00:36:23,420 --> 00:36:25,139
may never heal,

423
00:36:27,739 --> 00:36:29,780
and no one truly understands it.

424
00:36:31,420 --> 00:36:32,940
I know you and Pingjun

425
00:36:33,400 --> 00:36:35,099
are not only beloved spouses,

426
00:36:36,119 --> 00:36:37,679
but also close comrades

427
00:36:38,280 --> 00:36:40,119
with shared ideals.

428
00:36:41,079 --> 00:36:42,260
But for this reason,

429
00:36:44,320 --> 00:36:46,079
you can't just fall.

430
00:36:47,139 --> 00:36:48,280
Nowadays,

431
00:36:48,840 --> 00:36:49,559
the old has not died,

432
00:36:49,559 --> 00:36:50,400
and the new has not been established.

433
00:36:50,940 --> 00:36:52,619
There is only war everywhere.

434
00:36:54,340 --> 00:36:55,239
I also know

435
00:36:57,460 --> 00:36:58,260
you are no longer

436
00:36:58,260 --> 00:36:59,619
the old Yu Changxuan.

437
00:37:01,420 --> 00:37:02,920
In your heart,

438
00:37:03,900 --> 00:37:05,739
there is not only the survival of Yu's army,

439
00:37:06,920 --> 00:37:08,960
but also the welfare of the people of Nanhua,

440
00:37:09,900 --> 00:37:10,659
and even

441
00:37:12,619 --> 00:37:14,019
the way out of this country.

442
00:37:16,139 --> 00:37:17,380
The central government

443
00:37:17,380 --> 00:37:18,519
is falling apart.

444
00:37:19,840 --> 00:37:21,340
Its collapse is just a matter of time.

445
00:37:22,599 --> 00:37:23,840
All the warlords

446
00:37:24,699 --> 00:37:26,460
are standing at the crossroads of history.

447
00:37:27,760 --> 00:37:29,300
Of course, you have the right to be sad,

448
00:37:30,380 --> 00:37:31,320
but not to be decadent

449
00:37:31,599 --> 00:37:32,760
or to exile yourself.

450
00:37:33,539 --> 00:37:34,300
No.

451
00:37:36,300 --> 00:37:37,860
You lie here, longing to die,

452
00:37:38,239 --> 00:37:39,659
thinking it's the end of everything.

453
00:37:41,159 --> 00:37:42,440
But have you ever thought about

454
00:37:45,219 --> 00:37:47,179
what Pingjun would want to see most?

455
00:37:48,920 --> 00:37:49,920
Does she want you to

456
00:37:49,920 --> 00:37:50,920
fall into despair,

457
00:37:52,300 --> 00:37:53,500
or rise up

458
00:37:54,000 --> 00:37:55,619
and fulfill her vision

459
00:37:56,619 --> 00:37:58,420
of a future where children

460
00:37:58,480 --> 00:37:59,420
don't lose their fathers,

461
00:37:59,420 --> 00:38:00,539
and wives their husbands?

462
00:38:09,880 --> 00:38:11,119
Please, for Pingjun,

463
00:38:13,719 --> 00:38:14,780
for the child,

464
00:38:17,920 --> 00:38:19,340
and for your brother,

465
00:38:22,440 --> 00:38:23,440
go see

466
00:38:25,239 --> 00:38:26,780
the better days

467
00:38:28,260 --> 00:38:29,780
they never got to witness.

468
00:39:50,960 --> 00:39:51,860
Cover the low ground on the left

469
00:39:52,019 --> 00:39:53,039
with machine gun fire

470
00:39:53,139 --> 00:39:54,199
to suppress their charge.

471
00:39:54,380 --> 00:39:54,760
Yes, sir.

472
00:40:02,880 --> 00:40:03,380
Fire!

473
00:40:20,079 --> 00:40:20,780
Fire!

474
00:40:26,460 --> 00:40:27,519
Second platoon, follow me!

475
00:40:27,719 --> 00:40:29,139
Retake the lost ground!

476
00:40:29,519 --> 00:40:30,159
Go!

477
00:40:31,159 --> 00:40:31,800
Go!

478
00:40:31,900 --> 00:40:33,599
Charge!

479
00:40:37,420 --> 00:40:38,260
Guys,

480
00:40:38,659 --> 00:40:39,340
follow me!

481
00:41:04,500 --> 00:41:05,340
General,

482
00:41:05,500 --> 00:41:06,559
The logistics department has confirmed

483
00:41:07,920 --> 00:41:08,619
that the last batch of ammunition

484
00:41:08,619 --> 00:41:09,760
from the central government

485
00:41:10,320 --> 00:41:11,800
was ordered to return midway.

486
00:41:12,059 --> 00:41:12,880
The US embassy

487
00:41:12,880 --> 00:41:14,739
officially approached the central government

488
00:41:14,880 --> 00:41:15,420
to suspend

489
00:41:15,420 --> 00:41:16,880
all our supplies.

490
00:41:18,980 --> 00:41:19,820
The reason

491
00:41:20,460 --> 00:41:21,559
is to avoid unnecessary escalation

492
00:41:21,599 --> 00:41:22,719
of regional conflicts

493
00:41:23,360 --> 00:41:24,500
and urge all parties to exercise restraint.

494
00:41:26,179 --> 00:41:28,739
What a good reason!

495
00:41:29,699 --> 00:41:30,980
Yu's scheme

496
00:41:32,179 --> 00:41:35,099
has finally found a way to deal with the Jun family.

497
00:41:35,719 --> 00:41:37,019
He has dealt with the problem from the root.

498
00:41:37,800 --> 00:41:39,599
He played a good trick.

499
00:41:40,780 --> 00:41:41,539
Commander,

500
00:41:41,860 --> 00:41:43,480
the Yu family army is too strong.

501
00:41:43,659 --> 00:41:44,920
We can't hold on.

502
00:41:54,679 --> 00:41:55,860
Cut off the supplies.

503
00:41:57,599 --> 00:41:59,019
Fight the enemy with all our strength.

504
00:42:21,320 --> 00:42:22,920
Retreat!

505
00:42:24,019 --> 00:42:24,659
Hurry!

506
00:42:30,699 --> 00:42:31,639
Retreat!

507
00:44:10,960 --> 00:44:12,239
After all these years,

508
00:44:12,519 --> 00:44:13,619
Ye Pingjun,

509
00:44:14,099 --> 00:44:15,239
I never thought

510
00:44:15,780 --> 00:44:17,260
you'd end up

511
00:44:17,559 --> 00:44:18,739
being kept by a man

512
00:44:19,860 --> 00:44:21,559
as a canary

513
00:44:22,219 --> 00:44:23,239
once again.

514
00:44:28,420 --> 00:44:29,519
Miss Tao,

515
00:44:31,519 --> 00:44:33,500
I just want to leave here.

516
00:44:35,500 --> 00:44:36,780
Are you begging me?

517
00:44:41,099 --> 00:44:43,099
Jiang Xueting went to great lengths

518
00:44:43,219 --> 00:44:44,400
to invite you here.

519
00:44:45,000 --> 00:44:45,579
How could he

520
00:44:45,579 --> 00:44:46,960
let you go easily?

521
00:44:47,760 --> 00:44:50,860
You took Changxuan

522
00:44:51,119 --> 00:44:52,460
and my father back then.

523
00:44:52,900 --> 00:44:54,619
Now that you're in my hands,

524
00:44:55,719 --> 00:44:57,159
I'm not a man,

525
00:44:57,980 --> 00:44:59,360
I won't be seduced by you.

526
00:45:06,139 --> 00:45:07,760
I'm pregnant.

527
00:45:08,960 --> 00:45:11,039
This is Changxuan's child.

528
00:45:13,739 --> 00:45:14,559
What?

529
00:45:16,440 --> 00:45:17,860
Are you showing off to me?

530
00:45:19,780 --> 00:45:21,579
I'm not showing off to you.

531
00:45:22,880 --> 00:45:24,360
I'm just telling you

532
00:45:25,420 --> 00:45:27,579
why I have to leave this place.

533
00:45:29,380 --> 00:45:30,960
As a mother,

534
00:45:32,500 --> 00:45:34,340
I just want him to be safe.

535
00:45:47,679 --> 00:45:49,260
I just told you

536
00:45:50,320 --> 00:45:52,199
this is Changxuan's child.

537
00:45:54,059 --> 00:45:54,679
I can see

538
00:45:54,679 --> 00:45:56,300
you're not angry anymore.

539
00:45:58,960 --> 00:45:59,960
Now,

540
00:46:00,760 --> 00:46:02,360
the person in your heart

541
00:46:03,719 --> 00:46:05,079
is no longer him,

542
00:46:05,699 --> 00:46:06,559
right?

543
00:46:13,440 --> 00:46:15,239
You're right.

544
00:46:23,039 --> 00:46:24,260
Staying here

545
00:46:25,619 --> 00:46:27,380
is a burden for you,

546
00:46:28,719 --> 00:46:30,420
and a cage for me.

547
00:46:33,900 --> 00:46:35,260
Let me go.

548
00:46:37,739 --> 00:46:39,559
It's best for all of us.

549
00:46:51,559 --> 00:46:53,079
I might feel sorry

550
00:46:53,880 --> 00:46:54,860
for any woman

551
00:46:54,860 --> 00:46:56,420
in this situation,

552
00:47:00,559 --> 00:47:01,900
But for Ye Pingjun,

553
00:47:03,019 --> 00:47:04,800
I will never help you.

554
00:47:05,699 --> 00:47:07,260
I want to see you

555
00:47:07,579 --> 00:47:09,320
living miserably

556
00:47:10,699 --> 00:47:12,940
more than anyone else.
